    "text": "<b>Side A</b>\nYou cannot choose more than 2 heroes during setup.\n<b>Setup:</b> Choose a non-neutral unique ally from your deck and put it into play. Add the sum of that ally's printed [willpower], [attack], [defense], and hit points to your starting threat. Then, flip this card over and attach it to that ally.\n<b>Side B</b>\nAttached ally loses the ally card type and gains the hero card type.\nAttached character cannot be readied more than once per phase.\nMessenger of the King is immune to card effects while attached character is in play.\n<b>If attached character leaves play, remove Messenger of the King from the game.</b>",
